{
  "id": "frontend-slate-notes",
  "title": "Slate 编辑器里踩过的几个坑",
  "summary": "软换行、void 元素、跨块选区——都是文档里查不到、只能自己撞出来的细节。",
  "categoryId": "frontend",
  "tagIds": ["frontend", "react", "ts"],
  "createdAt": "2026-10-16T09:00:00.000Z",
  "reads": 0,
  "status": "published",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-16T09:00:00.000Z",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "85c8068c-4da1-4309-8c42-07087d203302",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Slate 的类型系统很灵活，但几个常见操作和直觉不一样，记录下来省得下次再撞。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "cf451336-dc99-4350-a2d0-0c7445d557e4",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "软换行不是 insertSoftBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "1c5bb248-0df8-46f7-90cf-79876ee46c73",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "本项目用的 0.126 版本里，Editor.insertSoftBreak 实际是拆块，而不是插入换行符。想让 Shift+Enter 在段内换行，得直接 Transforms.insertText(editor, '\\n')，并且给文本节点加 white-space: pre-wrap，否则换行会被折叠成空格。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "2b2532ac-5f7f-4ef3-b8d3-d66684ea4403",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "void 元素要用 voids: true"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "75c8f36c-d8b7-40c8-9b74-9f885d74977a",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "公式、画板、图表这些自绘元素是 void，addMark 进不去。改它们的属性要走 Editor.nodes({ voids: true }) 配合 Transforms.setNodes({ voids: true })，否则看起来「按钮亮了但没生效」。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "24814d79-ad43-461d-b62d-34990b2be83c",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "跨块选区别用 Editor.above"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "afe916aa-b321-4efa-a2f8-31403cfc9090",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "跨多块时 Editor.above 返回 undefined，面板会误判成不可用。取选区涉及的块应该用 Editor.nodes({ at: selection, mode: 'highest' })，并且 match 里要先用 Element.isElement 守卫，不然根节点也会被当成块命中。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
